# Editing Policy

- Only modify files in this repo. Do not change files in $HOME or system paths unless explicitly asked.
- Prefer zsh as the interactive shell in terminal configs (e.g., Kitty), avoid forcing fish.
- When altering terminal launch binds, do not wrap commands with `fish -c`; rely on the terminal's default shell.
- Preserve existing indentation and formatting; keep edits minimal and localized.
- Before changing generated/copied config, prefer updating the source files in [.config/](mdc:.config/) so downstream installs inherit the behavior.
